== B4 keepAlive honest boundary (EXEC 裁撤佐证·落卷) ==
主证1 A1 参数生效: pool.options keepAlive=true/initial=10000 (packages/db/test/ha3-pool-resilience.proof.ts 全绿)
主证2 A1-live 存储面: 真实连接 client.connection._keepAlive===true + _keepAliveInitialDelayMillis===10000 (pg@8.22.0 connection.js:24-25) 全绿
